  "translations": {
    "en": {
      "ipip_likert_1": "Very Inaccurate",
      "ipip_likert_2": "Moderately Inaccurate",
      "ipip_likert_3": "Neither Accurate Nor Inaccurate",
      "ipip_likert_4": "Moderately Accurate",
      "ipip_likert_5": "Very Accurate",
      "ipip_question_head": "<h3>How Accurately Can You Describe Yourself?</h3><p>Describe yourself as you generally are now, not as you wish to be in the future. Describe yourself as you honestly see yourself, in relation to other people you know of the same sex as you are, and roughly your same age. So that you can describe yourself in an honest manner, your responses will be kept in absolute confidence. Indicate the accuracy of the item as it applies to you, using the following rating scale:</p>",
      "ipip_debrief": "Thank you for completing this questionnaire.",
      "ipip_H106": "Accept people as they are.",
      "ipip_E65": "Am quick to judge others.",
      "ipip_D100": "Become frustrated and angry with people when they don't live up to my expectations.",
      "ipip_H279": "Criticize others' shortcomings.",
      "ipip_H1067": "Find fault with everything.",
      "ipip_H22": "Have a good word for everyone.",
      "ipip_E120": "Rarely complain.",
      "ipip_H1124": "Speak ill of others.",
      "ipip_E144": "Take things as they come.",
      "ipip_Q253": "Act impulsively when something is bothering me.",
      "ipip_H252": "Avoid mistakes.",
      "ipip_H1351": "Do things according to a plan.",
      "ipip_Q243": "Do things without thinking of the consequences.",
      "ipip_E57": "Don't know why I do some of the things I do.",
      "ipip_E46": "Jump into things without thinking.",
      "ipip_Q66": "Make a fool of myself.",
      "ipip_R75": "Make careless mistakes.",
      "ipip_X263": "Make plans and stick to them.",
      "ipip_H853": "Make rash decisions.",
      "ipip_P342": "Act like different people in different situations.",
      "ipip_Q35": "Don't pretend to be more than I am.",
      "ipip_Q49": "Find it necessary to please the people who have power.",
      "ipip_P399": "Let people push me around to help them feel important.",
      "ipip_Q6": "Play a role in order to impress people.",
      "ipip_X113": "Pretend to be concerned for others.",
      "ipip_P491": "Put on a show to impress people.",
      "ipip_Q125": "Switch my loyalties when I feel like it.",
      "ipip_A141": "Tell other people what they want to hear so that they will do what I want them to do.",
      "ipip_X91": "Use flattery to get ahead.",
      "ipip_H1070": "Adjust easily.",
      "ipip_E82": "Am annoyed by others' mistakes.",
      "ipip_H1068": "Am good at taking advice.",
      "ipip_H687": "Am hard to convince.",
      "ipip_H277": "Am hard to satisfy.",
      "ipip_H292": "Can't stand being contradicted.",
      "ipip_R24": "Get upset if others change the way that I have arranged things.",
      "ipip_Q54": "React strongly to criticism.",
      "ipip_D39": "When interacting with a group of people, am often bothered by at least one of them.",
      "ipip_A108": "Admire a really clever scam.",
      "ipip_Q22": "Cheat on people who have trusted me.",
      "ipip_X198": "Cheat to get ahead.",
      "ipip_E80": "Return extra change when a cashier makes a mistake.",
      "ipip_A119": "Steal things.",
      "ipip_X150": "Try to follow the rules.",
      "ipip_D102": "Would feel very badly for a long time if I were to steal from someone.",
      "ipip_X136": "Would never cheat on my taxes.",
      "ipip_P367": "Would never take things that aren't mine.",
      "ipip_D86": "Would not regret my behavior if I were to take advantage of someone impulsively.",
      "ipip_R44": "Am a physical coward.",
      "ipip_Q95": "Am willing to take risks.",
      "ipip_Q50": "Begin to panic when there is danger.",
      "ipip_Q126": "Face danger confidently.",
      "ipip_R53": "Like to do frightening things.",
      "ipip_R69": "Love dangerous situations.",
      "ipip_Q5": "Tremble in dangerous situations.",
      "ipip_Q31": "Would be good at rescuing people from a burning building.",
      "ipip_R52": "Would fear walking in a high-crime part of a city.",
      "ipip_Q136": "Would never go riding down a stretch of rapids in a canoe.",
      "ipip_R35": "Am considered to be kind of eccentric.",
      "ipip_H691": "Do things that others find strange.",
      "ipip_D73": "Know that my ideas sometimes surprise people.",
      "ipip_R6": "Like to be thought of as a normal kind of person.",
      "ipip_D88": "Like to be viewed as proper and conventional.",
      "ipip_Q207": "Rebel against authority.",
      "ipip_H690": "Swim against the current.",
      "ipip_E171": "Try to avoid complex people.",
      "ipip_D46": "Would hate to be considered odd or strange.",
      "ipip_X253": "Am deeply moved by others' misfortunes.",
      "ipip_D93": "Am seldom bothered by the apparent suffering of strangers.",
      "ipip_Q256": "Am sensitive to the needs of others.",
      "ipip_E136": "Feel others' emotions.",
      "ipip_D116": "Immediately feel sad when hearing of an unhappy event.",
      "ipip_A56": "Rarely cry during sad movies.",
      "ipip_D65": "Seldom feel weepy while reading the sad part of a story.",
      "ipip_X29": "Seldom get emotional.",
      "ipip_Q210": "Am easily annoyed.",
      "ipip_D63": "Am usually a patient person.",
      "ipip_D68": "Find that it takes a lot to make me feel angry at someone.",
      "ipip_H754": "Get angry easily.",
      "ipip_H761": "Get irritated easily.",
      "ipip_X95": "Get upset easily.",
      "ipip_H755": "Lose my temper.",
      "ipip_D113": "Rarely feel angry with people.",
